  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya, South Africa, Tanzania, Uganda. All four organisations in the partnership have a unifying focus on protecting and promoting fundamental human rights, and in particular the rights of those members of society who are most vulnerable to having their rights and freedoms violated. The proposed project is grounded in the exchange of skills and methodologies that will strengthen the partner organisations&#x2019; capacity in their work to protect and promote fundamental human rights. It has a special focus on protecting the most vulnerable members of society, including children, youth, members of minority groups and victims of sexual violence.</narrative>
  </description>
